  <section class="spec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head" style="padding-top:64px;">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">SPECIFICATION</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything the wrapper does</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">01</span><div class="spec-title">One generic component</div><p class="spec-desc">A single &lt;Chart&gt; per framework — set `type`, not a different import per chart.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">02</span><div class="spec-title">8 built-in chart types</div><p class="spec-desc">Bar, Line, Bubble, Doughnut, Pie, Polar Area, Radar, Scatter.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">03</span><div class="spec-title">5 ecosystem extensions</div><p class="spec-desc">Financial (candlestick/OHLC), boxplot/violin, matrix, sankey, treemap.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">04</span><div class="spec-title">10 official plugins</div><p class="spec-desc">Zoom/pan, annotations, data labels, gradient, timestack, hierarchical, image label, autocolors, deferred, and trendline — all wired in and typed.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">05</span><div class="spec-title">Lazy type registration</div><p class="spec-desc">Only the chart controllers you actually use are registered — tree-shaking preserved.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">06</span><div class="spec-title">TypeScript-first</div><p class="spec-desc">Every prop, config, and chart kind typed and exported from one entry point.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">07</span><div class="spec-title">Responsive by default</div><p class="spec-desc">Canvas resize handling built into the shared core, not left to each framework.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">08</span><div class="spec-title">Framework-agnostic core</div><p class="spec-desc">Chart lifecycle and registry logic usable standalone, no framework required.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">09</span><div class="spec-title">Mixed &amp; combo charts</div><p class="spec-desc">Bar+line combination charts via Chart.js's own per-dataset `type`.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">10</span><div class="spec-title">Reactive updates</div><p class="spec-desc">Data/options changes diffed into the live chart, not a full destroy/recreate.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">11</span><div class="spec-title">Battle-tested</div><p class="spec-desc">Vitest unit/component tests, Playwright e2e, and mutation testing across all three.</p></div>
      <div class="spec-cell"><span class="spec-icon">12</span><div class="spec-title">Theme-aware</div><p class="spec-desc">Light/dark token re-application on theme change, handled by the core.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

